Setup            dustydisk

# Mesh parameters

Nx               1                      # Number of cells in azimuth
Ny               1024                # Number of cells in radius

Xmin            -3.141592653589793      # Left coordinate of the box in azimuth
Xmax             3.141592653589793      # Right coordinate of the box in azimuth
Ymin             0.3                    # Left coordinate of the box in radius
Ymax             30.0                    # Right coordinate of the box in radius

# Gasesous disk parameters

AspectRatio     0.05                    # Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0          1.0e-4                     # Surface Density at r=1
SigmaSlope      0.5                 Slope for the surface density
Alpha		    1.0e-7

# Dusty phase parameters
Epsilon         0.04                   # Dust-to-gas mass ratio

# Drag force parameters
Ts              0.02                    # Lower values imply a greater coupling

# Output parameters
DT              0.6283185307179586        # Time steo for fine-grain monitoring
Ninterm         10                         # Number of DT between hydro outputs
Ntot            20000                     # Total number of DTs
OutputDir       /project/phys-k/fargo_share/fargo_dustydisk_St0.02_nobin_1d       # Output directory

# Buffer zone parameters (Only if -DSTOCKHOLM is enabled in accretion.opt)

DampingZone     1.15                    # Radial range for damping (in period-ratios)
TauDamp         0.1                     # Damping timescale (in units of Omega**(-1))


Spacing             Log                      Non-uniform spacing from a mesh-density function

Frame               F                       Method for moving the frame of reference
OmegaFrame          0.0                  Angular velocity for the frame of reference (If Frame is F).
